{"seq":4,"slug":"microservices","title":"微服务架构","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"service-decomposition","title":"服务拆分与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/service-decomposition","wordCount":1269,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"service-discovery","title":"服务注册与发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/service-discovery","wordCount":1168,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"api-gateway","title":"API 网关与 BFF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/api-gateway","wordCount":1137,"readingTime":5},{"seq":4,"slug":"distributed-tracing","title":"分布式链路追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/distributed-tracing","wordCount":877,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"微服务架构-简介\">微服务架构 简介</h1><p>微服务架构将单一应用拆分为一组小型、自治的服务，每个服务围绕特定业务能力构建，独立部署和扩展。这种架构风格在应对复杂业务系统时展现出强大的灵活性，但也带来了分布式系统固有的复杂性——服务发现、负载均衡、链路追踪、容错处理等问题需要系统性地解决。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>01</td>\n<td>服务拆分与边界</td>\n<td>DDD、限界上下文、拆分策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>02</td>\n<td>服务注册与发现</td>\n<td>注册中心、客户端/服务端发现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>03</td>\n<td>API 网关与 BFF</td>\n<td>统一入口、协议转换、BFF 模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>04</td>\n<td>分布式链路追踪</td>\n<td>OpenTelemetry、Trace/Span、可观测性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[服务拆分] --&gt; B[服务发现]&#10;  B --&gt; C[API 网关]&#10;  C --&gt; D[链路追踪]&#10;  D --&gt; E[全面可观测性]\">graph LR\n  A[服务拆分] --&gt; B[服务发现]\n  B --&gt; C[API 网关]\n  C --&gt; D[链路追踪]\n  D --&gt; E[全面可观测性]</pre><h2 id=\"核心观点\">核心观点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>微服务不是银弹</strong>：拆分过细会带来分布式事务、数据一致性等复杂度</li>\n<li><strong>组织架构决定系统架构</strong>：康威定律——系统设计反映组织结构</li>\n<li><strong>可观测性是生命线</strong>：没有完善的监控、追踪和日志，微服务将难以运维</li>\n<li><strong>演进式拆分</strong>：从单体出发，在明确边界后逐步拆分，避免过早微服务化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>分布式系统基础（网络通信、故障模型）</li>\n<li>容器与编排基础（Docker、Kubernetes）</li>\n<li>RESTful API 与 RPC 基础</li>\n</ul>\n"}